{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12686","headline":"游潓泉示泉上学者 · 元结","name":"游潓泉示泉上学者","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"顾吾漫浪久，不欲有所拘。\n每到潓泉上，情性可安舒。\n草堂在山曲，澄澜涵阶除。\n松竹阴幽径，清源涌坐隅。\n筑塘列圃畦，引流灌时蔬。\n复在郊郭外，正堪静者居。\n惬心则自适，喜尚人或殊。\n此中若可安，不服铜虎符。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元结","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12686.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12686","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}